Add type annotations for two polymorphic view helpers.

The upstream sky.toml had no go.dependencies — the go_ffi=true was set in
error. The .sky source is pure Sky stdlib. After the rename-map transform,
two top-level functions (viewJob, viewSnapshot) remain fully polymorphic
because their record-field access is consistent with multiple types; Ipê
reports IPE-L0102. Add explicit annotations so the type-checker can
monomorphise them.

--- a/src/Main.ipe
+++ b/src/Main.ipe
@@ -337,6 +337,7 @@
     Sub.none


+viewJob : Job -> Html Msg
 viewJob job =
     let
         status =
@@ -351,6 +352,7 @@
         div [] [text """#{{jid}} {{jname}} - {{status}}"""]


+viewSnapshot : Snapshot -> Html Msg
 viewSnapshot snap =
     let
         okStr = String.fromInt snap.ok
